    "turn_text": "You mentioned your 10 years on the Cook County Board. There were two issues. You were a leader of reform there, but there were two issues that you were deeply associated with. One was the environmental issue which you've spoken to. The other were gay rights issues. and you were really a leader on those part of it, your district encompassed a large active gay population, but there's obviously more to it. Why were you so motivated by these issues?",
